raffles and competitions – as well as a percentage of the craft sales - is divided between St. Andrew’s Church and a local charity. Last year, thanks to your generosity, we were able to donate over 6,000, and we want to beat last year\'s total!  This year we are supporting the Alzheimer’s Society.  This illness affects so many people’s lives.  Please help us to raise as much as we can.\nIf you can donate any good books or bric-a-brac, please let us know. We are happy to collect locally.  Thank you.',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,52.205300,0.121800,1687415,NULL,NULL,1,1,'Pending',0,NULL);
